:6.12,"text":"has no"},{"start":928.28,"duration":5.88,"text":"correlated data in the site files."},{"start":932.44,"duration":4.88,"text":"So,"},{"start":934.16,"duration":7.0,"text":"again, split"},{"start":937.32,"duration":3.84,"text":"work for multiple chunks"},{"start":941.44,"duration":9.12,"text":"run the parallel execution and merge."},{"start":945.44,"duration":7.88,"text":"The first approach of our runtime"},{"start":950.56,"duration":4.68,"text":"was doing the splitting physically. So,"},{"start":953.32,"duration":4.36,"text":"if we are talking about the network"},{"start":955.24,"duration":5.6,"text":"drive or network share,"},{"start":957.68,"duration":4.52,"text":"so that just split physically splitting"},{"start":960.84,"duration":4.04,"text":"big files"},{"start":962.2,"duration":6.72,"text":"to small small chunks"},{"start":964.88,"duration":5.84,"text":"was actually not not efficient, right?"},{"start":968.92,"duration":4.52,"text":"So,"},{"start":970.72,"duration":4.96,"text":"the next step that that we introduce"},{"start":973.44,"duration":6.68,"text":"was actually"},{"start":975.68,"duration":7.2,"text":"virtual virtual split. So, instead of"},{"start":980.12,"duration":4.44,"text":"instead of physically"},{"start":982.88,"duration":3.96,"text":"splitting files,"},{"start":984.56,"duration":5.8,"text":"we allow the one thread to read the"},{"start":986.84,"duration":5.08,"text":"file, find proper offset in the file, so"},{"start":990.36,"duration":2.84,"text":"just do this"},{"start":991.92,"duration":2.28,"text":"division"},{"start":993.2,"duration":3.84,"text":"and"},{"start":994.2,"duration":6.52,"text":"persist this information somewhere"},{"start":997.04,"duration":4.84,"text":"in in the storage that can be"},{"start":1000.72,"duration":4.56,"text":"consumed"},{"start":1001.88,"duration":3.4,"text":"in the next execution."},{"start":1005.36,"duration":6.72,"text":"And again, this was the third"},{"start":1008.6,"duration":3.48,"text":"sec