."},{"start":1161.72,"duration":4.68,"text":"And it's kind of, you know, pointers for"},{"start":1163.92,"duration":3.96,"text":"the particular files."},{"start":1166.4,"duration":4.12,"text":"So, imagine that"},{"start":1167.88,"duration":6.72,"text":"after this"},{"start":1170.52,"duration":5.96,"text":"after this, the next programs"},{"start":1174.6,"duration":5.36,"text":"the next programs in the chain can use"},{"start":1176.48,"duration":6.68,"text":"it as well. So, they read the meta meta"},{"start":1179.96,"duration":6.48,"text":"data data information and use it without"},{"start":1183.16,"duration":6.28,"text":"needs for the splitting or merging or"},{"start":1186.44,"duration":3.0,"text":"whatever you think."},{"start":1189.68,"duration":5.24,"text":"So, again"},{"start":1191.48,"duration":8.6,"text":"putting this together allow us to"},{"start":1194.92,"duration":9.6,"text":"have big benefits from multiple minutes"},{"start":1200.08,"duration":4.44,"text":"to single minutes in the execution."},{"start":1204.68,"duration":4.52,"text":"So, so that was two kind of scenarios"},{"start":1207.48,"duration":3.52,"text":"that we had"},{"start":1209.2,"duration":3.08,"text":"during this reporting"},{"start":1211.0,"duration":3.4,"text":"journey"},{"start":1212.28,"duration":4.88,"text":"that need to meet"},{"start":1214.4,"duration":4.6,"text":"the strict regulated SLA"},{"start":1217.16,"duration":5.32,"text":"and"},{"start":1219.0,"duration":4.64,"text":"performance challenges."},{"start":1222.48,"duration":4.12,"text":"What else?"},{"start":1223.64,"duration":5.28,"text":"If we are talking about the"},{"start":1226.6,"duration":4.44,"text":"the kind of"},{"start":1228.92,"duration":4.36,"text":"changes that we need to do"},{"start":1231.04,"duration":3.84,"text":"so, we are we completely remove the"},{"start":1233.28,"duration":5.96,"text":"queuing system."},{"start":1234.88,"duration":5.96,"text":"So, we use the outbox pattern on the"},{"start":1239.24,"durati